  "summary_en": "Socio-legal analysis of how law and society are unprepared for symbiosis with intelligent autonomous robots, examining legal, social, economic, gender and ethical perspectives, including robot legal subjecthood, liability and Asimov's laws. It calls for multi-disciplinary stakeholder discussion to derive policies, frameworks and roadmaps.",
